[{"id":"eb05bad","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"65ae3d8","elType":"widget","settings":{"shortcode":"[elementor-template id=3639]"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"shortcode"},{"id":"4a8a2d4","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='et et-hero et-hero-s'><picture><source media='(max-width:700px)' srcset='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-mographe-30949484-600x810.jpg'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-mographe-30949484-1536x1021.jpg' alt='' fetchpriority='high' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-mographe-30949484-scaled.jpg' onerror=etF(this)></picture><span class='et-arch-o'></span><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-crumb'><a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/'>Home</a> / <a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/destination/'>Tours</a> / Moroccan Coastal & Desert Expedition</div><span class='et-eye'>Desert & coast · 7 days</span><h1>Moroccan Coastal & Desert Expedition</h1><p class='lead'>A journey combining Morocco’s deserts, coastal towns, and rich culture — ideal for travelers with 5–10 days to explore.</p><div class='et-ctas'><a class='et-btn' href='#et-iti'>See the day-by-day plan <svg aria-hidden='true' width='16' height='16'><use href='#et-i-arrow'/></svg></a><a class='et-btn et-btn-w et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Moroccan%20Coastal%20and%20Desert%20Expedition%20(7%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section><div class='et'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-facts'><div><b>7 days</b><span>6 nights</span></div><div><b>Marrakech</b><span>starting point</span></div><div><b>Marrakech</b><span>end of the tour</span></div><div><b>Private</b><span>your own driver &amp; vehicle</span></div></div></div></div><section class='et et-sec' id='et-iti'><div class='et-wrap et-tour'><div><h3 style='font-size:20px'>Route</h3><div class='et-stops'><span>Marrakech</span><span>Ait Benhaddou</span><span>Draa Valley</span><span>Zagora</span><span>Erg Chigaga</span><span>Lac Iriki</span><span>Taroudant</span><span>Agadir</span><span>Essaouira</span></div><div class='et-iti-h'><div><span class='et-eye'>Itinerary</span><h2>Day by day</h2></div><button type='button' class='et-tog' data-o='0'>Open all days</button></div><div class='et-iti'><details class='et-day et-rv' open><summary><span class='et-node'>1</span><small>Day 1</small><b>Marrakech · Zagora</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Depart Marrakech early morning, heading south through the Atlas Mountains. Stop at the Kasbah of Ait Ben Haddou, a walled city with six historic kasbahs. Continue to Ouarzazate, home of Atlas Film Studios and famous film locations. Drive through the lush Draa Valley, lined with palm groves and kasbahs, arriving in Zagora for overnight stay at a local hotel.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>2</span><small>Day 2</small><b>Zagora · Erg Chigaga Sahara Desert</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Travel two hours south and then two hours off-road to Erg Chigaga, a remote Sahara region. Trek by camel through the dunes to a Berber camp. Dinner and overnight in well-equipped nomad tents or bivouac under the stars.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>3</span><small>Day 3</small><b>Chigaga · Iriki · Tata · Taroudant</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>After sunrise, drive toward Taroudant, traveling off-road through Erg Chigaga and the Lac Iriki dry lakebed, famous from the Paris-Dakar rally. Stop for lunch at Foum Zguid, continue through the Anti-Atlas argan-tree biosphere reserve, arriving at Taroudant, known as the ‘Grandmother of Marrakech’ for its ramparts and charm.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>4</span><small>Day 4</small><b>Taroudant · Agadir</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Morning walking tour of Taroudant’s vibrant markets and ancient city walls. Afterward, drive to Agadir, Morocco’s sunshine capital, through the scenic Sous Valley.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>5</span><small>Day 5</small><b>Agadir</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Day dedicated to cycling, guided walks, or beach activities. Visit Croco Park to see 325 Nile crocodiles in a botanical setting, then ride the cable car to the panoramic old kasbah of Agadir. Activities can be customized at booking.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>6</span><small>Day 6</small><b>Agadir · Essaouira</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive to Essaouira via a beautiful argan forest, spotting goats climbing the trees. Explore the coastal town, stroll along the windy beaches, and watch world-class windsurfers in action.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>7</span><small>Day 7</small><b>Essaouira · Marrakech</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Return to Marrakech. End of the Moroccan Coastal and Desert Expedition, highlighting deserts, eco areas, and coastal beauty. Farewell and thanks for choosing Epic Travel Morocco.</p></div></details></div><div class='et-note'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-info'/></svg><div><b>Tailor-made:</b> Every itinerary can be adapted — start date, number of days, hotels and stops. Tell us your dates and we send you a detailed quote.</div></div></div><aside class='et-side'><div class='et-book'><div class='et-book-h et-dark'><h3>Book this tour</h3><p>Free quote within 24 hours — no payment to ask.</p></div><ul><li><span>Duration</span><b>7 days / 6 nights</b></li><li><span>Start</span><b>Marrakech</b></li><li><span>End</span><b>Marrakech</b></li><li><span>Style</span><b>Desert & coast</b></li><li><span>Type</span><b>Private tour</b></li></ul><div class='et-book-f'><a class='et-btn et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Moroccan%20Coastal%20and%20Desert%20Expedition%20(7%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a><a class='et-btn et-btn-o' href='mailto:epictravelmorocco@gmail.com?subject=Moroccan%20Coastal%20and%20Desert%20Expedition'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-mail'/></svg>Email us</a><a class='et-btn' href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/contact-2/'>Send a request</a><small>WhatsApp +212 661 292 596 · Tel +1 579 484 7707</small></div></div></aside></div></section><section class='et et-sec et-pat'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-head'><div class='et-orn'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-star'/></svg></div><span class='et-eye'>You may also like</span><h2>More Morocco tours</h2></div><div class='et-grid'><a class='et-card et-rv' href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/all-tour/morocco-north-to-south-explorer/'><div class='et-card-img'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-122137131-592426555f9b58f4c07ffd43-600x810.jpg' width='600' height='810' alt='Morocco North to South Explorer – Morocco tour' loading='lazy' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/GettyImages-122137131-592426555f9b58f4c07ffd43.jpg' onerror=etF(this)><span class='et-days'><b>10</b> days · from Tangier</span></div><div class='et-card-b'><span class='et-kind'>Grand tour</span><h3>Morocco North to South Explorer</h3><p class='et-route'>Tangier · Chefchaouen · Volubilis · Meknes …</p